  "description": "What: Urban fight suite U2 (DESIGN_Urban_Fight_Suite.md §5, user 2026-11-20) - the CORNER FIGHT: 'Blue Squad' (Friend, 6 men, mortal) bounds up demo-city's residential street (x 639-661, between the res-bw and res-be rows) toward the junction with the shop street (y ≈ 400), objective (650,430). 'Red Squad' (Hostile, 6 men, no order: the default SOP) holds the junction's two near corners - three men behind res-bw-21's front (x 627-633, y 384) and three behind res-be-22's (x 666-671, y 386) - out of the street's sight until a man leans out. Contact comes at 10-40 m. Judge (checks.json, the realism rubric §1): both sides fire, each within 5 s of the other's first round; nobody in the fight stands upright in the open 10 s in an enemy's sight; no squad knot held 10 s; no friendly hits; Red hits Blue, and Blue - ambushed from the corners - answers and gets out of Red's sight within 30 s (a squad that breaks contact need not score; user 2026-11-21). Layer-4 review: does Red lean out or step into the street, does Blue keep to the walls, suppress the corner, flank through the shop street or a building, or walk into the mouth in a column."
 },
